><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">20<small>minutes</small></div></a></div></section>","recipes":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>All recipes</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:700\">All recipes</h1><p class=\"lead\">Eight weeknight dinners. Filter by time or style.</p></div></section><section class=\"dt-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"dt-wrap\"><aside class=\"dt-rail\"><div><h4>Time</h4><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-f=\"min\" value=\"25\">Under 25 min</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-f=\"min\" value=\"35\">Under 35 min</label></div><div><h4>Style</h4><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-f=\"tag\" value=\"vegetarian\">Vegetarian</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-f=\"tag\" value=\"one pan\">One pan</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-f=\"tag\" value=\"quick\">Quick</label></div></aside><div><div class=\"dt-list\"><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"35\" data-tag=\"one pan\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#d8472b;--c2:#7a5a8a\"></div><div><h3>Sheet-pan chicken & vegetables</h3><p>Chicken thighs, Potatoes, Carrots, Olive oil and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>one pan</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">35<small>minutes</small></div></a><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"30\" data-tag=\"vegetarian\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#e0a526;--c2:#3a2745\"></div><div><h3>Lentil & spinach dal</h3><p>Red lentils, Spinach, Onion, Garlic and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>vegetarian</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">30<small>minutes</small></div></a><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"20\" data-tag=\"quick\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#3a2745;--c2:#7a9a5a\"></div><div><h3>Beef & broccoli stir-fry</h3><p>Beef sirloin, Broccoli, Garlic, Soy sauce and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>quick</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">20<small>minutes</small></div></a><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"20\" data-tag=\"vegetarian\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#d8472b;--c2:#7a9a5a\"></div><div><h3>Tomato basil pasta</h3><p>Spaghetti, Tinned tomatoes, Garlic, Basil and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>vegetarian</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">20<small>minutes</small></div></a><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"25\" data-tag=\"quick\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#e8765a;--c2:#7a9a5a\"></div><div><h3>Salmon, rice & cucumber salad</h3><p>Salmon fillets, Rice, Cucumber, Soy sauce and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>quick</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">25<small>minutes</small></div></a><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"20\" data-tag=\"vegetarian\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#3a2745;--c2:#e0a526\"></div><div><h3>Black bean tacos</h3><p>Black beans, Tortillas, Avocado, Lime and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>vegetarian</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">20<small>minutes</small></div></a><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"40\" data-tag=\"vegetarian\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#a08060;--c2:#e0a526\"></div><div><h3>Mushroom risotto</h3><p>Arborio rice, Mushrooms, Onion, Stock and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>vegetarian</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">40<small>minutes</small></div></a><a class=\"dt-row\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-min=\"20\" data-tag=\"quick\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#e0a526;--c2:#d8472b\"></div><div><h3>Chicken fried rice</h3><p>Rice, Chicken breast, Eggs, Peas and more.</p><div class=\"tg\"><span>quick</span><span>serves 4</span></div></div><div class=\"tm\">20<small>minutes</small></div></a></div></div></div></section><script>(function(){var c=document.querySelectorAll(\".dt-rail input\");if(!c.length)return;function u(){var m=[],t=[];c.forEach(function(i){if(i.checked){(i.dat